# HF Digital Modes Rules

- CAT control troubleshooting must check serial device permissions (`/dev/ttyUSB*` in `dialout` group).
- CI-V frame validation requires preambles `0xFE 0xFE` and termination `0xFD`.
- Audio calibration instructions must enforce zero ALC deflection to prevent intermodulation distortion (IMD).
